{const c={"id":"mudlogging-cuttings-v22","sceneId":"m1","title":"岩屑岩性自动识别：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"岩屑是钻头破碎的岩石碎片，随钻井液返出后被捞取、清洗和观察。颜色、粒度和纹理可辅助岩性描述，但混样、污染和光照会影响识别。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"最近类中心分类 + 曝光归一化","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"岩性类别、组分统计的基础","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"仅分类合成特征，未处理真实显微图像，也未实现混合岩性多标签识别。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"岩屑岩性自动识别概念图\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#c59048\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#74876d\"/><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a6b4b2\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#c59048\"/><circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#74876d\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a6b4b2\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#c59048\"/><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#74876d\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a6b4b2\"/><circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#c59048\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"125\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#74876d\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"125\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a6b4b2\"/><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"125\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#c59048\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"125\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#74876d\"/><circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"125\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a6b4b2\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#345648\">粒度 / 纹理 / 色调 → 岩性候选</text></svg><p>概念示意，非真实样品或现场曲线。</p><p>岩屑是钻头破碎的岩石碎片，随钻井液返出后被捞取、清洗和观察。颜色、粒度和纹理可辅助岩性描述，但混样、污染和光照会影响识别。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：色调和纹理的二维合成特征。方法：最近类中心分类 + 曝光归一化。输出：岩性类别、组分统计的基础。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>采样与标定</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>提取颜色纹理</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>学习类别中心</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>混淆矩阵复核</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>曝光变化 → 特征偏移 → 标定校正 → 分类。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的色调和纹理的二维合成特征，并由录井解释或验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；图像案例使用特征代理，不加载真实图像。报告训练与测试语料独立，规模仅作原理说明。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>仅分类合成特征，未处理真实显微图像，也未实现混合岩性多标签识别。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-mud-logging\">SLB：录井、迟到与荧光概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/naive_bayes.html\">朴素贝叶斯原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"岩屑岩性自动识别：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 采样与标定","role":"数据","do":"固定光照、曝光与样品处理，按样品或井划分训练测试。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 提取颜色纹理","role":"学习","do":"360 个训练特征向量计算各级/类均值，建立类中心。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 学习类别中心","role":"推理","do":"用已知曝光倍率归一化，再将测试特征分到最近类中心。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 混淆矩阵复核","role":"验收","do":"120 个独立测试样本计算准确率与混淆矩阵，与未校正基线比较。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"仅分类合成特征，未处理真实显微图像，也未实现混合岩性多标签识别。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>采样与标定</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>提取颜色纹理</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>学习类别中心</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>混淆矩阵复核</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"曝光、污染、脱气效率或钻井参数变化可造成分布漂移。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"岩屑混样、迟到校正与解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"仅分类合成特征，未处理真实显微图像，也未实现混合岩性多标签识别。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2936,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>岩屑岩性自动识别</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>岩屑岩性自动识别</h1><p class=\"lead\">岩屑是钻头破碎的岩石碎片，随钻井液返出后被捞取、清洗和观察。颜色、粒度和纹理可辅助岩性描述，但混样、污染和光照会影响识别。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>曝光标定倍率 ×100 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"曝光标定倍率 ×100\" type=\"range\" min=\"40\" max=\"160\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 词语缺失 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">类别编码：0=砂岩；1=泥岩；2=灰岩。图中单位及曲线含义见右侧说明。</div><figure><figcaption>观测特征样本：框色表示预测是否命中</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"观测特征样本：框色表示预测是否命中\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>分类混淆矩阵：行真值、列预测</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"分类混淆矩阵：行真值、列预测\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>最近类中心分类 + 曝光归一化；400条独立训练样本，换井不改变训练参数。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">仅分类合成特征，未处理真实显微图像，也未实现混合岩性多标签识别。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13316,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"cuttings\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":100,\"inspect\":\"输入为曝光校正后的色调/纹理代理。真值和输出为类别编码，分类特征不含真值。左图颜色由观测特征编码，不是显微照片。\",\"classes\":[\"砂岩\",\"泥岩\",\"灰岩\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),colors=['#43836b','#c59048','#648eae','#a2739b'];\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction centroid(samples,n){return Array.from({length:n},(_,k)=>{let a=samples.filter(d=>d.y===k);return a[0].x.map((_,j)=>a.reduce((v,d)=>v+d.x[j],0)/a.length)})}\nfunction classify(x,centers){let distances=centers.map(c=>c.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-x[j])**2,0));return distances.indexOf(Math.min(...distances))}\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel){let g=$(id).getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';const px=i=>55+i/(series[0].v.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;for(let i=0;i<5;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dde5d9';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#475d51';g.fillText(v.toFixed(1),4,y)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,200,328);for(let i=0;i<5;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].v.length-1)/4),55+i*140,306);for(const s of series){g.strokeStyle=s.c;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.v.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()}}\nfunction confusion(truth,pred,n){let m=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n).fill(0));truth.forEach((v,i)=>m[v][pred[i]]++);let g=$('b').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='14px sans-serif';g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText('行：真值；列：预测。数字为样本数',20,25);for(let i=0;i<n;i++){g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText(SPEC.classes[i],10,78+i*55);g.fillText(SPEC.classes[i],140+i*110,48);for(let j=0;j<n;j++){g.fillStyle=i===j?'#d6e9d8':'#f4e9dc';g.fillRect(140+j*110,55+i*55,100,45);g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText(m[i][j],180+j*110,84+i*55)}}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17);if(TYPE==='gas'){let a=Array.from({length:400},()=>.7+r()*.6);return {mean:a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/400,sd:Math.sqrt(a.reduce((s,v)=>s+(v-1)**2,0)/400)}}if(TYPE==='report'){let docs=[['气测 异常 全烃 升高 显示','显示'],['荧光 显示 含油 岩屑','显示'],['全烃 峰值 气测 显示','显示'],['接单根 停泵 工况 变化','工况'],['循环 停泵 恢复 工况','工况'],['扭矩 波动 工况 记录','工况'],['岩屑 砂岩 地层 岩性','岩性'],['泥岩 岩屑 岩性 描述','岩性'],['灰岩 地层 岩性 样品','岩性']];let cats=['显示','工况','岩性'],vocab=new Set(docs.flatMap(d=>d[0].split(' ')));return {cats,vocab,counts:cats.map(c=>{let count={},total=0;docs.filter(d=>d[1]===c).forEach(d=>d[0].split(' ').forEach(w=>{count[w]=(count[w]||0)+1;total++}));return {count,total}})}}let n=TYPE==='fluoro'?4:3,base=TYPE==='layers'?[[.3,.4],[.7,.8],[.5,.2]]:TYPE==='fluoro'?[[.16,.15],[.35,.28],[.58,.52],[.8,.72]]:[[.7,.3],[.25,.7],[.5,.5]],a=[];for(let i=0;i<360;i++){let y=i%n;a.push({x:base[y].map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*.14),y})}return {centers:centroid(a,n),base}})();\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction acc(t,p){return (100*t.filter((v,i)=>v===p[i]).length/t.length).toFixed(1)+'%'}\nfunction run(){const param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],features=[],n=SPEC.classes.length;const exposure=param/100;let g=$('a').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';g.fillStyle='#3c5746';g.fillText('合成图像特征示意（非真实显微照片），绿框为正确，橙框为错误',10,20);for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=Math.floor(r()*n),raw=model.base[y].map(v=>Math.max(0,Math.min(1,v*exposure+(r()-.5)*noise))),x=raw.map(v=>v/Math.max(.1,exposure)),p=classify(x,model.centers),b=classify(raw,model.centers);truth.push(y);pred.push(p);base.push(b);features.push(x);let px=12+i%15*41,py=38+Math.floor(i/15)*35;g.fillStyle=TYPE==='fluoro'?'rgb('+Math.round(raw[0]*150)+','+Math.round(raw[0]*255)+','+Math.round(raw[1]*130)+')':\"rgb(\"+Math.round(raw[0]*255)+\",\"+Math.round(raw[1]*255)+\",120)\";g.fillRect(px,py,30,24);g.strokeStyle=p===y?'#3c886a':'#ce8b43';g.strokeRect(px-1,py-1,32,26)}confusion(truth,pred,n);metrics([['归一化 + 学习',acc(truth,pred)],['未校正基线',acc(truth,base)],['训练 / 测试','360 / 120'],['曝光倍率',exposure.toFixed(2)]]);$('explain').textContent='从独立训练样本学习各类特征中心；用已知标定曝光倍率校正测试特征，再按最近中心分类。混淆矩阵同时展示误判方向。岩屑以合成色调与纹理代理特征演示；荧光以强度与颜色代理特征演示，并非识别真实照片。曝光变化会影响噪声放大与饱和截断，校正不能恢复已丢失信息。';head=['sample','feature_1','feature_2','truth_class','corrected_prediction','uncorrected_prediction'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,...features[i],v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='gas'){let truth=[],raw=[],score=[],pred=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let event=i>=45&&i<75,drift=.008*i,v=model.mean+drift+(event?1.4*Math.sin((i-45)/30*Math.PI):0)+(r()-.5)*noise;raw.push(v);let z=(v-drift-model.mean)/model.sd;score.push(z);truth.push(event?1:0);pred.push(z>param/10?1:0);base.push(v>1.7?1:0)}function counts(p){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;p.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{f:(100*2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%',fp,fn}}let c=counts(pred);chart('a',[{v:raw,c:'#43836b'}],0,4,'序号（演示深度 = 2000 + 序号 m）','全烃 / 相对单位');chart('b',[{v:score,c:'#43836b'},{v:score.map(()=>param/10),c:'#c59048'},{v:truth.map(v=>v*8),c:'#648eae'}],-4,12,'深度采样序号','校正后 z 分数 / 阈值 / 真值×8');metrics([['学习基线 F1',c.f],['固定阈值 F1',counts(base).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['实际阈值',(param/10).toFixed(1)]]);$('explain').textContent='400 个正常样本学习全烃基线均值和标准差。演示用已知合成漂移作为工况校正量，校正后计算 z 分数并检测异常段。蓝色抬升为真值区间（乘 8 便于显示），橙为阈值；不是油气水类型鉴定，也不能排除接单根气或脱气效率变化。';head=['depth_m','total_gas_relative','z_score','truth','alarm','fixed_threshold_alarm'];rows=raw.map((v,i)=>[2000+i,v,score[i],truth[i],pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='layers'){let truth=[],raw=[],pred=[],curve=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=i<40?0:i<80?1:2,x=model.base[y].map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*noise);truth.push(y);curve.push(x[0]*10);raw.push(classify(x,model.centers))}let half=Math.floor(param/2);for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let votes=[0,0,0];for(let j=Math.max(0,i-half);j<=Math.min(119,i+half);j++)votes[raw[j]]++;pred.push(votes.indexOf(Math.max(...votes)))}let boundaries=a=>a.map((v,i)=>i&&v!==a[i-1]?i:-1).filter(i=>i>=0),edges=boundaries(pred),used=new Set(),tp=0;for(const e of edges){let k=[40,80].find(v=>Math.abs(v-e)<=2&&!used.has(v));if(k!==undefined){used.add(k);tp++}}let f=100*2*tp/Math.max(1,edges.length+2);chart('a',[{v:curve,c:'#43836b'}],0,12,'采样序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 m）','钻时 / min·m⁻¹');chart('b',[{v:truth,c:'#c59048'},{v:pred,c:'#43836b'},{v:raw,c:'#648eae'}],-.2,2.4,'深度采样序号','类别编码 0 / 1 / 2');metrics([['平滑分类准确率',acc(truth,pred)],['逐点基线准确率',acc(truth,raw)],['界面 F1（±2 m）',f.toFixed(1)+'%'],['预测界面数',edges.length]]);$('explain').textContent='从独立样本学习钻时与辅助录井特征的类别中心，逐点分类后采用可调多数窗平滑。橙：真值；绿：平滑；蓝：逐点。真值界面 2040、2080 m，按 ±2 m 一对一匹配计算界面 F1；大窗口可能抹掉薄层，本例不含迟到校正模块。';head=['depth_m','drilling_time_min_m','truth','smoothed','pointwise'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[2000+i,curve[i],v,pred[i],raw[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='report'){let records=[['R01','岩屑 砂岩 岩性 深度 2030 m'],['R02','气测 全烃 升高 显示 深度 2050 m'],['R03','停泵 接单根 工况 深度 2070 m'],['R04','岩屑 泥岩 岩性 深度 2090 m'],['R05','荧光 含油 显示 深度 2110 m'],['R06','循环 恢复 工况 深度 2130 m']];let truth=[2,0,1,2,0,1],pred=[],confidence=[],missing=0;records=records.map(([id,text])=>[id,text.split(' ').filter(word=>r()>noise*.7||/\\d/.test(word)).join(' ')]);for(let i=0;i<records.length;i++){let tokens=records[i][1].split(' '),logs=model.counts.map(c=>tokens.reduce((sum,w)=>sum+(model.vocab.has(w)?Math.log(((c.count[w]||0)+1)/(c.total+model.vocab.size)):0),Math.log(1/3))),mx=Math.max(...logs),weights=logs.map(v=>Math.exp(v-mx)),p=logs.indexOf(mx),conf=weights[p]/weights.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0);pred.push(p);confidence.push(conf);if(conf<param/100)missing++}confusion(truth,pred,3);chart('a',[{v:confidence,c:'#43836b'},{v:confidence.map(()=>param/100),c:'#c59048'}],0,1,'记录序号（R01–R06 对应 0–5）','分类后验分数 / 复核阈值');let report=[];for(let i=0;i<records.length;i++){let [id,text]=records[i],depth=text.match(/\\b(\\d{4})\\s*m\\b/),low=confidence[i]<param/100;report.push('['+id+'] '+(depth?depth[1]+' m':'深度缺失')+'｜'+(low?'待人工分类':model.cats[pred[i]])+'｜原始证据：'+text+'。'+(pred[i]===0?'仅记录显示，不推断产能或流体结论。':''))}$('report').textContent='录井报告初稿（待审核）\\n'+report.join('\\n');metrics([['文本分类准确率',acc(truth,pred)],['待复核记录',missing+' / 6'],['证据引用覆盖率','100%'],['训练记录 / 测试记录','9 / 6']]);$('explain').textContent='由 9 条短训练语料学习多项式朴素贝叶斯词频分布，使用拉普拉斯平滑进行记录分类。正则提取深度，按受约束模板生成带 R 编号的初稿。噪声滑块模拟词语缺失；阈值只控制转人工，不改变分类。后验分数未经校准，不能当作事实正确概率；这是 NLP 教学样例，不是大语言模型。';head=['source_id','source_text','truth_class','predicted_class','posterior_score','needs_review'];rows=records.map((v,i)=>[...v,truth[i],pred[i],confidence[i],confidence[i]<param/100?1:0]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<div>结果前五行（类别编码从 0 开始，见图例）</div><table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction labels(){$('pv').value=$('param').value+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2)}function flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){labels();if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(let id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='mudlog-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)};\n\nlet selected=5;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='report'?'训练：9条短语料；词表大小 '+model.vocab.size+'；类别 '+model.cats.join(' / '):JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent=TYPE==='report'?rows[selected][0]:'序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='gas'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):+(r[2]!==r[3]));$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">逐样本错误位置：高柱=判错，低柱=一致；横轴为原始记录顺序</text>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(130-v*85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+(v?85:3)+'\" fill=\"'+(v?'#b26a39':'#2f7d6b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect();selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width))*(rows.length-1));if(TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'){let x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640,y=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*340;selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(119,Math.floor((y-38)/35)*15+Math.floor((x-12)/41)))}inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=5;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"mudlogging-gas-v22","sceneId":"m2","title":"气测异常智能解释：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"气测监测返出气体中的全烃及组分。峰值可能与油气显示有关，也受脱气效率、停泵和钻井液条件影响，不能仅凭气峰判定产能。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"学习正常基线 + 校正后 z 分数","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"异常段候选，不进行油气水鉴定","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"演示漂移量已知；现场必须估计并验证工况校正，不能把峰值直接解释为油气层。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"气测异常智能解释概念图\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><polyline points=\"20,129.99994531957415 24,129.9998985504779 28,129.99981437509047 32,129.99966504178255 36,129.99940390819592 40,129.99895382630328 44,129.9981892329844 48,129.99690906775365 52,129.99479663216468 56,129.99136131371392 60,129.9858557797664 64,129.9771609282338 68,129.96362977224916 72,129.94288085154494 76,129.91153213224064 80,129.86486821046407 84,129.796437569167 88,129.69758323681341 92,129.55691992007598 96,129.35978370731004 100,129.08769647860436 104,128.71790527778862 108,128.22307537560363 112,127.57123200476904 116,126.72605643312286 120,125.64764331845186 124,124.29381429627173 128,122.6220542806695 132,120.59209025569822 136,118.16906792157538 140,115.32720289942316 144,112.05369703195115 148,108.35262649466594 152,104.24843911799904 156,99.78865656547636 160,95.04537479805066 164,90.11520226883539 168,85.11737280990317 172,80.18991546307421 176,75.48394518500166 180,71.15633796658463 184,67.36124782299412 188,64.24108560305669 192,61.91768660185562 196,60.48442712567788 200,60 204,60.48442712567788 208,61.91768660185562 212,64.24108560305669 216,67.36124782299412 220,71.15633796658463 224,75.48394518500166 228,80.18991546307421 232,85.11737280990317 236,90.11520226883539 240,95.04537479805066 244,99.78865656547636 248,104.24843911799904 252,108.35262649466594 256,112.05369703195115 260,115.32720289942316 264,118.16906792157538 268,120.59209025569822 272,122.6220542806695 276,124.29381429627173 280,125.64764331845186 284,126.72605643312286 288,127.57123200476904 292,128.22307537560363 296,128.71790527778862 300,129.08769647860436 304,129.35978370731004 308,129.55691992007598 312,129.69758323681341 316,129.796437569167 320,129.86486821046407 324,129.91153213224064 328,129.94288085154494 332,129.96362977224916 336,129.9771609282338 340,129.9858557797664 344,129.99136131371392 348,129.99479663216468 352,129.99690906775365 356,129.9981892329844 360,129.99895382630328 364,129.99940390819592 368,129.99966504178255 372,129.99981437509047 376,129.9998985504779\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345648\">气峰 ≠ 已确认油气层</text></svg><p>概念示意，非真实样品或现场曲线。</p><p>气测监测返出气体中的全烃及组分。峰值可能与油气显示有关，也受脱气效率、停泵和钻井液条件影响，不能仅凭气峰判定产能。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：相对全烃、已知合成漂移校正量。方法：学习正常基线 + 校正后 z 分数。输出：异常段候选，不进行油气水鉴定。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>对齐迟到深度</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习正常分布</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>校正漂移并检测</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>核对误报漏报</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>正常参考 → 工况校正 → z 分数 → 阈值报警。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的相对全烃、已知合成漂移校正量，并由录井解释或验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；图像案例使用特征代理，不加载真实图像。报告训练与测试语料独立，规模仅作原理说明。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>演示漂移量已知；现场必须估计并验证工况校正，不能把峰值直接解释为油气层。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-mud-logging\">SLB：录井、迟到与荧光概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/naive_bayes.html\">朴素贝叶斯原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"气测异常智能解释：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 对齐迟到深度","role":"数据","do":"按深度对齐全烃和工况信息，现场需校正迟到时间。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 学习正常分布","role":"学习","do":"400 个正常训练样本估计均值与标准差。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 校正漂移并检测","role":"推理","do":"移除已知合成工况漂移后，按 z 分数阈值提出异常候选。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 核对误报漏报","role":"验收","do":"用独立真值区间统计 TP、FP、FN 与 F1，观察阈值权衡。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"演示漂移量已知；现场必须估计并验证工况校正，不能把峰值直接解释为油气层。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>对齐迟到深度</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习正常分布</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>校正漂移并检测</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>核对误报漏报</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"曝光、污染、脱气效率或钻井参数变化可造成分布漂移。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"岩屑混样、迟到校正与解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"演示漂移量已知；现场必须估计并验证工况校正，不能把峰值直接解释为油气层。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2890,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>气测异常智能解释</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>气测异常智能解释</h1><p class=\"lead\">气测监测返出气体中的全烃及组分。峰值可能与油气显示有关，也受脱气效率、停泵和钻井液条件影响，不能仅凭气峰判定产能。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>异常阈值 ×10 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"异常阈值 ×10\" type=\"range\" min=\"5\" max=\"40\" value=\"20\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 词语缺失 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">类别编码：0=背景；1=异常。图中单位及曲线含义见右侧说明。</div><figure><figcaption>全烃观测序列（含合成工况漂移）</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"全烃观测序列（含合成工况漂移）\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>校正后分数、阈值与真值区间</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"校正后分数、阈值与真值区间\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>学习正常基线 + 校正后 z 分数；400条独立训练样本，换井不改变训练参数。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">演示漂移量已知；现场必须估计并验证工况校正，不能把峰值直接解释为油气层。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13271,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"gas\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":20,\"inspect\":\"深度单位m，全烃为相对单位。漂移校正量在此例已知；异常分数不是含油气概率，标签仅做逐点验收。\",\"classes\":[\"背景\",\"异常\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),colors=['#43836b','#c59048','#648eae','#a2739b'];\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction centroid(samples,n){return Array.from({length:n},(_,k)=>{let a=samples.filter(d=>d.y===k);return a[0].x.map((_,j)=>a.reduce((v,d)=>v+d.x[j],0)/a.length)})}\nfunction classify(x,centers){let distances=centers.map(c=>c.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-x[j])**2,0));return distances.indexOf(Math.min(...distances))}\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel){let g=$(id).getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';const px=i=>55+i/(series[0].v.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;for(let i=0;i<5;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dde5d9';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#475d51';g.fillText(v.toFixed(1),4,y)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,200,328);for(let i=0;i<5;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].v.length-1)/4),55+i*140,306);for(const s of series){g.strokeStyle=s.c;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.v.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()}}\nfunction confusion(truth,pred,n){let m=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n).fill(0));truth.forEach((v,i)=>m[v][pred[i]]++);let g=$('b').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='14px sans-serif';g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText('行：真值；列：预测。数字为样本数',20,25);for(let i=0;i<n;i++){g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText(SPEC.classes[i],10,78+i*55);g.fillText(SPEC.classes[i],140+i*110,48);for(let j=0;j<n;j++){g.fillStyle=i===j?'#d6e9d8':'#f4e9dc';g.fillRect(140+j*110,55+i*55,100,45);g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText(m[i][j],180+j*110,84+i*55)}}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17);if(TYPE==='gas'){let a=Array.from({length:400},()=>.7+r()*.6);return {mean:a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/400,sd:Math.sqrt(a.reduce((s,v)=>s+(v-1)**2,0)/400)}}if(TYPE==='report'){let docs=[['气测 异常 全烃 升高 显示','显示'],['荧光 显示 含油 岩屑','显示'],['全烃 峰值 气测 显示','显示'],['接单根 停泵 工况 变化','工况'],['循环 停泵 恢复 工况','工况'],['扭矩 波动 工况 记录','工况'],['岩屑 砂岩 地层 岩性','岩性'],['泥岩 岩屑 岩性 描述','岩性'],['灰岩 地层 岩性 样品','岩性']];let cats=['显示','工况','岩性'],vocab=new Set(docs.flatMap(d=>d[0].split(' ')));return {cats,vocab,counts:cats.map(c=>{let count={},total=0;docs.filter(d=>d[1]===c).forEach(d=>d[0].split(' ').forEach(w=>{count[w]=(count[w]||0)+1;total++}));return {count,total}})}}let n=TYPE==='fluoro'?4:3,base=TYPE==='layers'?[[.3,.4],[.7,.8],[.5,.2]]:TYPE==='fluoro'?[[.16,.15],[.35,.28],[.58,.52],[.8,.72]]:[[.7,.3],[.25,.7],[.5,.5]],a=[];for(let i=0;i<360;i++){let y=i%n;a.push({x:base[y].map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*.14),y})}return {centers:centroid(a,n),base}})();\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction acc(t,p){return (100*t.filter((v,i)=>v===p[i]).length/t.length).toFixed(1)+'%'}\nfunction run(){const param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],features=[],n=SPEC.classes.length;const exposure=param/100;let g=$('a').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';g.fillStyle='#3c5746';g.fillText('合成图像特征示意（非真实显微照片），绿框为正确，橙框为错误',10,20);for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=Math.floor(r()*n),raw=model.base[y].map(v=>Math.max(0,Math.min(1,v*exposure+(r()-.5)*noise))),x=raw.map(v=>v/Math.max(.1,exposure)),p=classify(x,model.centers),b=classify(raw,model.centers);truth.push(y);pred.push(p);base.push(b);features.push(x);let px=12+i%15*41,py=38+Math.floor(i/15)*35;g.fillStyle=TYPE==='fluoro'?'rgb('+Math.round(raw[0]*150)+','+Math.round(raw[0]*255)+','+Math.round(raw[1]*130)+')':\"rgb(\"+Math.round(raw[0]*255)+\",\"+Math.round(raw[1]*255)+\",120)\";g.fillRect(px,py,30,24);g.strokeStyle=p===y?'#3c886a':'#ce8b43';g.strokeRect(px-1,py-1,32,26)}confusion(truth,pred,n);metrics([['归一化 + 学习',acc(truth,pred)],['未校正基线',acc(truth,base)],['训练 / 测试','360 / 120'],['曝光倍率',exposure.toFixed(2)]]);$('explain').textContent='从独立训练样本学习各类特征中心；用已知标定曝光倍率校正测试特征，再按最近中心分类。混淆矩阵同时展示误判方向。岩屑以合成色调与纹理代理特征演示；荧光以强度与颜色代理特征演示，并非识别真实照片。曝光变化会影响噪声放大与饱和截断，校正不能恢复已丢失信息。';head=['sample','feature_1','feature_2','truth_class','corrected_prediction','uncorrected_prediction'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,...features[i],v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='gas'){let truth=[],raw=[],score=[],pred=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let event=i>=45&&i<75,drift=.008*i,v=model.mean+drift+(event?1.4*Math.sin((i-45)/30*Math.PI):0)+(r()-.5)*noise;raw.push(v);let z=(v-drift-model.mean)/model.sd;score.push(z);truth.push(event?1:0);pred.push(z>param/10?1:0);base.push(v>1.7?1:0)}function counts(p){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;p.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{f:(100*2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%',fp,fn}}let c=counts(pred);chart('a',[{v:raw,c:'#43836b'}],0,4,'序号（演示深度 = 2000 + 序号 m）','全烃 / 相对单位');chart('b',[{v:score,c:'#43836b'},{v:score.map(()=>param/10),c:'#c59048'},{v:truth.map(v=>v*8),c:'#648eae'}],-4,12,'深度采样序号','校正后 z 分数 / 阈值 / 真值×8');metrics([['学习基线 F1',c.f],['固定阈值 F1',counts(base).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['实际阈值',(param/10).toFixed(1)]]);$('explain').textContent='400 个正常样本学习全烃基线均值和标准差。演示用已知合成漂移作为工况校正量，校正后计算 z 分数并检测异常段。蓝色抬升为真值区间（乘 8 便于显示），橙为阈值；不是油气水类型鉴定，也不能排除接单根气或脱气效率变化。';head=['depth_m','total_gas_relative','z_score','truth','alarm','fixed_threshold_alarm'];rows=raw.map((v,i)=>[2000+i,v,score[i],truth[i],pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='layers'){let truth=[],raw=[],pred=[],curve=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=i<40?0:i<80?1:2,x=model.base[y].map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*noise);truth.push(y);curve.push(x[0]*10);raw.push(classify(x,model.centers))}let half=Math.floor(param/2);for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let votes=[0,0,0];for(let j=Math.max(0,i-half);j<=Math.min(119,i+half);j++)votes[raw[j]]++;pred.push(votes.indexOf(Math.max(...votes)))}let boundaries=a=>a.map((v,i)=>i&&v!==a[i-1]?i:-1).filter(i=>i>=0),edges=boundaries(pred),used=new Set(),tp=0;for(const e of edges){let k=[40,80].find(v=>Math.abs(v-e)<=2&&!used.has(v));if(k!==undefined){used.add(k);tp++}}let f=100*2*tp/Math.max(1,edges.length+2);chart('a',[{v:curve,c:'#43836b'}],0,12,'采样序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 m）','钻时 / min·m⁻¹');chart('b',[{v:truth,c:'#c59048'},{v:pred,c:'#43836b'},{v:raw,c:'#648eae'}],-.2,2.4,'深度采样序号','类别编码 0 / 1 / 2');metrics([['平滑分类准确率',acc(truth,pred)],['逐点基线准确率',acc(truth,raw)],['界面 F1（±2 m）',f.toFixed(1)+'%'],['预测界面数',edges.length]]);$('explain').textContent='从独立样本学习钻时与辅助录井特征的类别中心，逐点分类后采用可调多数窗平滑。橙：真值；绿：平滑；蓝：逐点。真值界面 2040、2080 m，按 ±2 m 一对一匹配计算界面 F1；大窗口可能抹掉薄层，本例不含迟到校正模块。';head=['depth_m','drilling_time_min_m','truth','smoothed','pointwise'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[2000+i,curve[i],v,pred[i],raw[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='report'){let records=[['R01','岩屑 砂岩 岩性 深度 2030 m'],['R02','气测 全烃 升高 显示 深度 2050 m'],['R03','停泵 接单根 工况 深度 2070 m'],['R04','岩屑 泥岩 岩性 深度 2090 m'],['R05','荧光 含油 显示 深度 2110 m'],['R06','循环 恢复 工况 深度 2130 m']];let truth=[2,0,1,2,0,1],pred=[],confidence=[],missing=0;records=records.map(([id,text])=>[id,text.split(' ').filter(word=>r()>noise*.7||/\\d/.test(word)).join(' ')]);for(let i=0;i<records.length;i++){let tokens=records[i][1].split(' '),logs=model.counts.map(c=>tokens.reduce((sum,w)=>sum+(model.vocab.has(w)?Math.log(((c.count[w]||0)+1)/(c.total+model.vocab.size)):0),Math.log(1/3))),mx=Math.max(...logs),weights=logs.map(v=>Math.exp(v-mx)),p=logs.indexOf(mx),conf=weights[p]/weights.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0);pred.push(p);confidence.push(conf);if(conf<param/100)missing++}confusion(truth,pred,3);chart('a',[{v:confidence,c:'#43836b'},{v:confidence.map(()=>param/100),c:'#c59048'}],0,1,'记录序号（R01–R06 对应 0–5）','分类后验分数 / 复核阈值');let report=[];for(let i=0;i<records.length;i++){let [id,text]=records[i],depth=text.match(/\\b(\\d{4})\\s*m\\b/),low=confidence[i]<param/100;report.push('['+id+'] '+(depth?depth[1]+' m':'深度缺失')+'｜'+(low?'待人工分类':model.cats[pred[i]])+'｜原始证据：'+text+'。'+(pred[i]===0?'仅记录显示，不推断产能或流体结论。':''))}$('report').textContent='录井报告初稿（待审核）\\n'+report.join('\\n');metrics([['文本分类准确率',acc(truth,pred)],['待复核记录',missing+' / 6'],['证据引用覆盖率','100%'],['训练记录 / 测试记录','9 / 6']]);$('explain').textContent='由 9 条短训练语料学习多项式朴素贝叶斯词频分布，使用拉普拉斯平滑进行记录分类。正则提取深度，按受约束模板生成带 R 编号的初稿。噪声滑块模拟词语缺失；阈值只控制转人工，不改变分类。后验分数未经校准，不能当作事实正确概率；这是 NLP 教学样例，不是大语言模型。';head=['source_id','source_text','truth_class','predicted_class','posterior_score','needs_review'];rows=records.map((v,i)=>[...v,truth[i],pred[i],confidence[i],confidence[i]<param/100?1:0]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<div>结果前五行（类别编码从 0 开始，见图例）</div><table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction labels(){$('pv').value=$('param').value+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2)}function flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){labels();if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(let id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='mudlog-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)};\n\nlet selected=5;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='report'?'训练：9条短语料；词表大小 '+model.vocab.size+'；类别 '+model.cats.join(' / '):JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent=TYPE==='report'?rows[selected][0]:'序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='gas'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):+(r[2]!==r[3]));$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">逐样本错误位置：高柱=判错，低柱=一致；横轴为原始记录顺序</text>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(130-v*85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+(v?85:3)+'\" fill=\"'+(v?'#b26a39':'#2f7d6b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect();selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width))*(rows.length-1));if(TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'){let x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640,y=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*340;selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(119,Math.floor((y-38)/35)*15+Math.floor((x-12)/41)))}inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=5;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"mudlogging-fluoro-v22","sceneId":"m3","title":"荧光图像智能判读：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"紫外照射下观察岩屑的荧光颜色、强度与分布，可辅助含油性分析。矿物及钻井液添加剂也可能产生荧光，需结合溶剂试验和其他证据。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"最近类中心分级 + 强度校正","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"四个教学荧光强度等级","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"四级仅为教学强度编码，不是现场含油分级标准，不从荧光等级推断含油饱和度。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"荧光图像智能判读概念图\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#47604b\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#768c42\"/><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a8bd42\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#d9dd64\"/><circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#47604b\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#768c42\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a8bd42\"/><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#d9dd64\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#47604b\"/><circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"80\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#768c42\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"125\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a8bd42\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"125\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#d9dd64\"/><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"125\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#47604b\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"125\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#768c42\"/><circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"125\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a8bd42\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#345648\">紫外光 → 荧光颜色与强度 → 等级候选</text></svg><p>概念示意，非真实样品或现场曲线。</p><p>紫外照射下观察岩屑的荧光颜色、强度与分布，可辅助含油性分析。矿物及钻井液添加剂也可能产生荧光，需结合溶剂试验和其他证据。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：合成荧光强度和颜色代理特征。方法：最近类中心分级 + 强度校正。输出：四个教学荧光强度等级。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>固定灯源与曝光</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>提取强度颜色</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>学习分级中心</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>核查跨曝光误判</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>紫外激发 → 发光强度 → 标定 → 分级。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的合成荧光强度和颜色代理特征，并由录井解释或验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；图像案例使用特征代理，不加载真实图像。报告训练与测试语料独立，规模仅作原理说明。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>四级仅为教学强度编码，不是现场含油分级标准，不从荧光等级推断含油饱和度。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-mud-logging\">SLB：录井、迟到与荧光概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/naive_bayes.html\">朴素贝叶斯原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"荧光图像智能判读：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 固定灯源与曝光","role":"数据","do":"固定光照、曝光与样品处理，按样品或井划分训练测试。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 提取强度颜色","role":"学习","do":"360 个训练特征向量计算各级/类均值，建立类中心。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 学习分级中心","role":"推理","do":"用已知曝光倍率归一化，再将测试特征分到最近类中心。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 核查跨曝光误判","role":"验收","do":"120 个独立测试样本计算准确率与混淆矩阵，与未校正基线比较。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"四级仅为教学强度编码，不是现场含油分级标准，不从荧光等级推断含油饱和度。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>固定灯源与曝光</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>提取强度颜色</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>学习分级中心</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>核查跨曝光误判</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"曝光、污染、脱气效率或钻井参数变化可造成分布漂移。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"岩屑混样、迟到校正与解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"四级仅为教学强度编码，不是现场含油分级标准，不从荧光等级推断含油饱和度。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2899,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>荧光图像智能判读</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>荧光图像智能判读</h1><p class=\"lead\">紫外照射下观察岩屑的荧光颜色、强度与分布，可辅助含油性分析。矿物及钻井液添加剂也可能产生荧光，需结合溶剂试验和其他证据。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>曝光标定倍率 ×100 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"曝光标定倍率 ×100\" type=\"range\" min=\"40\" max=\"160\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 词语缺失 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">类别编码：0=弱；1=中弱；2=中强；3=强。图中单位及曲线含义见右侧说明。</div><figure><figcaption>荧光观测特征代理与判错位置</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"荧光观测特征代理与判错位置\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>教学强度分级混淆矩阵</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"教学强度分级混淆矩阵\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>最近类中心分级 + 强度校正；400条独立训练样本，换井不改变训练参数。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">四级仅为教学强度编码，不是现场含油分级标准，不从荧光等级推断含油饱和度。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13301,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"fluoro\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":100,\"inspect\":\"输入为校正后的强度和颜色代理；四级是教学编码，不是现场含油分级。饱和截断导致的信息无法靠除曝光恢复。\",\"classes\":[\"弱\",\"中弱\",\"中强\",\"强\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),colors=['#43836b','#c59048','#648eae','#a2739b'];\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction centroid(samples,n){return Array.from({length:n},(_,k)=>{let a=samples.filter(d=>d.y===k);return a[0].x.map((_,j)=>a.reduce((v,d)=>v+d.x[j],0)/a.length)})}\nfunction classify(x,centers){let distances=centers.map(c=>c.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-x[j])**2,0));return distances.indexOf(Math.min(...distances))}\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel){let g=$(id).getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';const px=i=>55+i/(series[0].v.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;for(let i=0;i<5;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dde5d9';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#475d51';g.fillText(v.toFixed(1),4,y)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,200,328);for(let i=0;i<5;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].v.length-1)/4),55+i*140,306);for(const s of series){g.strokeStyle=s.c;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.v.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()}}\nfunction confusion(truth,pred,n){let m=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n).fill(0));truth.forEach((v,i)=>m[v][pred[i]]++);let g=$('b').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='14px sans-serif';g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText('行：真值；列：预测。数字为样本数',20,25);for(let i=0;i<n;i++){g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText(SPEC.classes[i],10,78+i*55);g.fillText(SPEC.classes[i],140+i*110,48);for(let j=0;j<n;j++){g.fillStyle=i===j?'#d6e9d8':'#f4e9dc';g.fillRect(140+j*110,55+i*55,100,45);g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText(m[i][j],180+j*110,84+i*55)}}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17);if(TYPE==='gas'){let a=Array.from({length:400},()=>.7+r()*.6);return {mean:a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/400,sd:Math.sqrt(a.reduce((s,v)=>s+(v-1)**2,0)/400)}}if(TYPE==='report'){let docs=[['气测 异常 全烃 升高 显示','显示'],['荧光 显示 含油 岩屑','显示'],['全烃 峰值 气测 显示','显示'],['接单根 停泵 工况 变化','工况'],['循环 停泵 恢复 工况','工况'],['扭矩 波动 工况 记录','工况'],['岩屑 砂岩 地层 岩性','岩性'],['泥岩 岩屑 岩性 描述','岩性'],['灰岩 地层 岩性 样品','岩性']];let cats=['显示','工况','岩性'],vocab=new Set(docs.flatMap(d=>d[0].split(' ')));return {cats,vocab,counts:cats.map(c=>{let count={},total=0;docs.filter(d=>d[1]===c).forEach(d=>d[0].split(' ').forEach(w=>{count[w]=(count[w]||0)+1;total++}));return {count,total}})}}let n=TYPE==='fluoro'?4:3,base=TYPE==='layers'?[[.3,.4],[.7,.8],[.5,.2]]:TYPE==='fluoro'?[[.16,.15],[.35,.28],[.58,.52],[.8,.72]]:[[.7,.3],[.25,.7],[.5,.5]],a=[];for(let i=0;i<360;i++){let y=i%n;a.push({x:base[y].map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*.14),y})}return {centers:centroid(a,n),base}})();\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction acc(t,p){return (100*t.filter((v,i)=>v===p[i]).length/t.length).toFixed(1)+'%'}\nfunction run(){const param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],features=[],n=SPEC.classes.length;const exposure=param/100;let g=$('a').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';g.fillStyle='#3c5746';g.fillText('合成图像特征示意（非真实显微照片），绿框为正确，橙框为错误',10,20);for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=Math.floor(r()*n),raw=model.base[y].map(v=>Math.max(0,Math.min(1,v*exposure+(r()-.5)*noise))),x=raw.map(v=>v/Math.max(.1,exposure)),p=classify(x,model.centers),b=classify(raw,model.centers);truth.push(y);pred.push(p);base.push(b);features.push(x);let px=12+i%15*41,py=38+Math.floor(i/15)*35;g.fillStyle=TYPE==='fluoro'?'rgb('+Math.round(raw[0]*150)+','+Math.round(raw[0]*255)+','+Math.round(raw[1]*130)+')':\"rgb(\"+Math.round(raw[0]*255)+\",\"+Math.round(raw[1]*255)+\",120)\";g.fillRect(px,py,30,24);g.strokeStyle=p===y?'#3c886a':'#ce8b43';g.strokeRect(px-1,py-1,32,26)}confusion(truth,pred,n);metrics([['归一化 + 学习',acc(truth,pred)],['未校正基线',acc(truth,base)],['训练 / 测试','360 / 120'],['曝光倍率',exposure.toFixed(2)]]);$('explain').textContent='从独立训练样本学习各类特征中心；用已知标定曝光倍率校正测试特征，再按最近中心分类。混淆矩阵同时展示误判方向。岩屑以合成色调与纹理代理特征演示；荧光以强度与颜色代理特征演示，并非识别真实照片。曝光变化会影响噪声放大与饱和截断，校正不能恢复已丢失信息。';head=['sample','feature_1','feature_2','truth_class','corrected_prediction','uncorrected_prediction'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,...features[i],v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='gas'){let truth=[],raw=[],score=[],pred=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let event=i>=45&&i<75,drift=.008*i,v=model.mean+drift+(event?1.4*Math.sin((i-45)/30*Math.PI):0)+(r()-.5)*noise;raw.push(v);let z=(v-drift-model.mean)/model.sd;score.push(z);truth.push(event?1:0);pred.push(z>param/10?1:0);base.push(v>1.7?1:0)}function counts(p){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;p.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{f:(100*2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%',fp,fn}}let c=counts(pred);chart('a',[{v:raw,c:'#43836b'}],0,4,'序号（演示深度 = 2000 + 序号 m）','全烃 / 相对单位');chart('b',[{v:score,c:'#43836b'},{v:score.map(()=>param/10),c:'#c59048'},{v:truth.map(v=>v*8),c:'#648eae'}],-4,12,'深度采样序号','校正后 z 分数 / 阈值 / 真值×8');metrics([['学习基线 F1',c.f],['固定阈值 F1',counts(base).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['实际阈值',(param/10).toFixed(1)]]);$('explain').textContent='400 个正常样本学习全烃基线均值和标准差。演示用已知合成漂移作为工况校正量，校正后计算 z 分数并检测异常段。蓝色抬升为真值区间（乘 8 便于显示），橙为阈值；不是油气水类型鉴定，也不能排除接单根气或脱气效率变化。';head=['depth_m','total_gas_relative','z_score','truth','alarm','fixed_threshold_alarm'];rows=raw.map((v,i)=>[2000+i,v,score[i],truth[i],pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='layers'){let truth=[],raw=[],pred=[],curve=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=i<40?0:i<80?1:2,x=model.base[y].map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*noise);truth.push(y);curve.push(x[0]*10);raw.push(classify(x,model.centers))}let half=Math.floor(param/2);for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let votes=[0,0,0];for(let j=Math.max(0,i-half);j<=Math.min(119,i+half);j++)votes[raw[j]]++;pred.push(votes.indexOf(Math.max(...votes)))}let boundaries=a=>a.map((v,i)=>i&&v!==a[i-1]?i:-1).filter(i=>i>=0),edges=boundaries(pred),used=new Set(),tp=0;for(const e of edges){let k=[40,80].find(v=>Math.abs(v-e)<=2&&!used.has(v));if(k!==undefined){used.add(k);tp++}}let f=100*2*tp/Math.max(1,edges.length+2);chart('a',[{v:curve,c:'#43836b'}],0,12,'采样序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 m）','钻时 / min·m⁻¹');chart('b',[{v:truth,c:'#c59048'},{v:pred,c:'#43836b'},{v:raw,c:'#648eae'}],-.2,2.4,'深度采样序号','类别编码 0 / 1 / 2');metrics([['平滑分类准确率',acc(truth,pred)],['逐点基线准确率',acc(truth,raw)],['界面 F1（±2 m）',f.toFixed(1)+'%'],['预测界面数',edges.length]]);$('explain').textContent='从独立样本学习钻时与辅助录井特征的类别中心，逐点分类后采用可调多数窗平滑。橙：真值；绿：平滑；蓝：逐点。真值界面 2040、2080 m，按 ±2 m 一对一匹配计算界面 F1；大窗口可能抹掉薄层，本例不含迟到校正模块。';head=['depth_m','drilling_time_min_m','truth','smoothed','pointwise'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[2000+i,curve[i],v,pred[i],raw[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='report'){let records=[['R01','岩屑 砂岩 岩性 深度 2030 m'],['R02','气测 全烃 升高 显示 深度 2050 m'],['R03','停泵 接单根 工况 深度 2070 m'],['R04','岩屑 泥岩 岩性 深度 2090 m'],['R05','荧光 含油 显示 深度 2110 m'],['R06','循环 恢复 工况 深度 2130 m']];let truth=[2,0,1,2,0,1],pred=[],confidence=[],missing=0;records=records.map(([id,text])=>[id,text.split(' ').filter(word=>r()>noise*.7||/\\d/.test(word)).join(' ')]);for(let i=0;i<records.length;i++){let tokens=records[i][1].split(' '),logs=model.counts.map(c=>tokens.reduce((sum,w)=>sum+(model.vocab.has(w)?Math.log(((c.count[w]||0)+1)/(c.total+model.vocab.size)):0),Math.log(1/3))),mx=Math.max(...logs),weights=logs.map(v=>Math.exp(v-mx)),p=logs.indexOf(mx),conf=weights[p]/weights.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0);pred.push(p);confidence.push(conf);if(conf<param/100)missing++}confusion(truth,pred,3);chart('a',[{v:confidence,c:'#43836b'},{v:confidence.map(()=>param/100),c:'#c59048'}],0,1,'记录序号（R01–R06 对应 0–5）','分类后验分数 / 复核阈值');let report=[];for(let i=0;i<records.length;i++){let [id,text]=records[i],depth=text.match(/\\b(\\d{4})\\s*m\\b/),low=confidence[i]<param/100;report.push('['+id+'] '+(depth?depth[1]+' m':'深度缺失')+'｜'+(low?'待人工分类':model.cats[pred[i]])+'｜原始证据：'+text+'。'+(pred[i]===0?'仅记录显示，不推断产能或流体结论。':''))}$('report').textContent='录井报告初稿（待审核）\\n'+report.join('\\n');metrics([['文本分类准确率',acc(truth,pred)],['待复核记录',missing+' / 6'],['证据引用覆盖率','100%'],['训练记录 / 测试记录','9 / 6']]);$('explain').textContent='由 9 条短训练语料学习多项式朴素贝叶斯词频分布，使用拉普拉斯平滑进行记录分类。正则提取深度，按受约束模板生成带 R 编号的初稿。噪声滑块模拟词语缺失；阈值只控制转人工，不改变分类。后验分数未经校准，不能当作事实正确概率；这是 NLP 教学样例，不是大语言模型。';head=['source_id','source_text','truth_class','predicted_class','posterior_score','needs_review'];rows=records.map((v,i)=>[...v,truth[i],pred[i],confidence[i],confidence[i]<param/100?1:0]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<div>结果前五行（类别编码从 0 开始，见图例）</div><table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction labels(){$('pv').value=$('param').value+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2)}function flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){labels();if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(let id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='mudlog-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)};\n\nlet selected=5;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='report'?'训练：9条短语料；词表大小 '+model.vocab.size+'；类别 '+model.cats.join(' / '):JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent=TYPE==='report'?rows[selected][0]:'序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='gas'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):+(r[2]!==r[3]));$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">逐样本错误位置：高柱=判错，低柱=一致；横轴为原始记录顺序</text>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(130-v*85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+(v?85:3)+'\" fill=\"'+(v?'#b26a39':'#2f7d6b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect();selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width))*(rows.length-1));if(TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'){let x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640,y=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*340;selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(119,Math.floor((y-38)/35)*15+Math.floor((x-12)/41)))}inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=5;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"mudlogging-layers-v22","sceneId":"m4","title":"钻时曲线地层划分：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"钻时是钻进单位进尺所需时间，受岩石可钻性影响，也受钻压、转速等工况影响。突变可提示层界，但不能单独作为地层界面的充分证据。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"监督类中心 + 序列多数平滑","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"逐点层类与候选层界","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"本例三层宽度较大，未模拟薄互层或岩屑迟到校正；大平滑窗可能抹掉薄层。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"钻时曲线地层划分概念图\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><polyline points=\"20,125 24,125 28,125 32,125 36,125 40,125 44,125 48,125 52,125 56,125 60,125 64,125 68,125 72,125 76,125 80,125 84,125 88,125 92,125 96,125 100,125 104,125 108,125 112,125 116,125 120,125 124,125 128,125 132,125 136,125 140,55 144,55 148,55 152,55 156,55 160,55 164,55 168,55 172,55 176,55 180,55 184,55 188,55 192,55 196,55 200,55 204,55 208,55 212,55 216,55 220,55 224,55 228,55 232,55 236,55 240,55 244,55 248,55 252,55 256,55 260,90 264,90 268,90 272,90 276,90 280,90 284,90 288,90 292,90 296,90 300,90 304,90 308,90 312,90 316,90 320,90 324,90 328,90 332,90 336,90 340,90 344,90 348,90 352,90 356,90 360,90 364,90 368,90 372,90 376,90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345648\">钻时变化 ≠ 必然地层界面</text></svg><p>概念示意，非真实样品或现场曲线。</p><p>钻时是钻进单位进尺所需时间，受岩石可钻性影响，也受钻压、转速等工况影响。突变可提示层界，但不能单独作为地层界面的充分证据。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：钻时及辅助录井的二维合成特征。方法：监督类中心 + 序列多数平滑。输出：逐点层类与候选层界。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>统一深度与工况</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习多特征类别</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>投票平滑序列</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>容差匹配层界</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>逐点分类 → 滑窗投票 → 类别切换 → 层界。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的钻时及辅助录井的二维合成特征，并由录井解释或验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；图像案例使用特征代理，不加载真实图像。报告训练与测试语料独立，规模仅作原理说明。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>本例三层宽度较大，未模拟薄互层或岩屑迟到校正；大平滑窗可能抹掉薄层。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-mud-logging\">SLB：录井、迟到与荧光概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/naive_bayes.html\">朴素贝叶斯原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"钻时曲线地层划分：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 统一深度与工况","role":"数据","do":"按深度对齐钻时与辅助录井特征，独立井划分数据。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 学习多特征类别","role":"学习","do":"360 个合成训练点学习三类特征中心。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 投票平滑序列","role":"推理","do":"最近中心逐点分类，再用滑动窗口多数投票平滑。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 容差匹配层界","role":"验收","do":"对类别变化点提取层界，在 ±2 m 容差内一对一匹配真值。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"本例三层宽度较大，未模拟薄互层或岩屑迟到校正；大平滑窗可能抹掉薄层。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>统一深度与工况</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习多特征类别</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>投票平滑序列</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>容差匹配层界</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"曝光、污染、脱气效率或钻井参数变化可造成分布漂移。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"岩屑混样、迟到校正与解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"本例三层宽度较大，未模拟薄互层或岩屑迟到校正；大平滑窗可能抹掉薄层。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2881,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>钻时曲线地层划分</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>钻时曲线地层划分</h1><p class=\"lead\">钻时是钻进单位进尺所需时间，受岩石可钻性影响，也受钻压、转速等工况影响。突变可提示层界，但不能单独作为地层界面的充分证据。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>多数平滑窗口（点） <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"多数平滑窗口（点）\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"15\" value=\"5\" step=\"2\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 词语缺失 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">类别编码：0=层类 A；1=层类 B；2=层类 C。图中单位及曲线含义见右侧说明。</div><figure><figcaption>钻时观测曲线</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"钻时观测曲线\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>真值、逐点分类和平滑后的类别</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"真值、逐点分类和平滑后的类别\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>监督类中心 + 序列多数平滑；400条独立训练样本，换井不改变训练参数。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">本例三层宽度较大，未模拟薄互层或岩屑迟到校正；大平滑窗可能抹掉薄层。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13296,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"layers\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":5,\"inspect\":\"钻时单位min/m；类别编码见图例。平滑后的类别切换作为候选层界，按±2m一对一匹配。大窗口可能隐藏薄层。\",\"classes\":[\"层类 A\",\"层类 B\",\"层类 C\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),colors=['#43836b','#c59048','#648eae','#a2739b'];\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction centroid(samples,n){return Array.from({length:n},(_,k)=>{let a=samples.filter(d=>d.y===k);return a[0].x.map((_,j)=>a.reduce((v,d)=>v+d.x[j],0)/a.length)})}\nfunction classify(x,centers){let distances=centers.map(c=>c.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-x[j])**2,0));return distances.indexOf(Math.min(...distances))}\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel){let g=$(id).getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';const px=i=>55+i/(series[0].v.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;for(let i=0;i<5;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dde5d9';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#475d51';g.fillText(v.toFixed(1),4,y)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,200,328);for(let i=0;i<5;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].v.length-1)/4),55+i*140,306);for(const s of series){g.strokeStyle=s.c;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.v.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()}}\nfunction confusion(truth,pred,n){let m=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n).fill(0));truth.forEach((v,i)=>m[v][pred[i]]++);let g=$('b').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='14px sans-serif';g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText('行：真值；列：预测。数字为样本数',20,25);for(let i=0;i<n;i++){g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText(SPEC.classes[i],10,78+i*55);g.fillText(SPEC.classes[i],140+i*110,48);for(let j=0;j<n;j++){g.fillStyle=i===j?'#d6e9d8':'#f4e9dc';g.fillRect(140+j*110,55+i*55,100,45);g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText(m[i][j],180+j*110,84+i*55)}}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17);if(TYPE==='gas'){let a=Array.from({length:400},()=>.7+r()*.6);return {mean:a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/400,sd:Math.sqrt(a.reduce((s,v)=>s+(v-1)**2,0)/400)}}if(TYPE==='report'){let docs=[['气测 异常 全烃 升高 显示','显示'],['荧光 显示 含油 岩屑','显示'],['全烃 峰值 气测 显示','显示'],['接单根 停泵 工况 变化','工况'],['循环 停泵 恢复 工况','工况'],['扭矩 波动 工况 记录','工况'],['岩屑 砂岩 地层 岩性','岩性'],['泥岩 岩屑 岩性 描述','岩性'],['灰岩 地层 岩性 样品','岩性']];let cats=['显示','工况','岩性'],vocab=new Set(docs.flatMap(d=>d[0].split(' ')));return {cats,vocab,counts:cats.map(c=>{let count={},total=0;docs.filter(d=>d[1]===c).forEach(d=>d[0].split(' ').forEach(w=>{count[w]=(count[w]||0)+1;total++}));return {count,total}})}}let n=TYPE==='fluoro'?4:3,base=TYPE==='layers'?[[.3,.4],[.7,.8],[.5,.2]]:TYPE==='fluoro'?[[.16,.15],[.35,.28],[.58,.52],[.8,.72]]:[[.7,.3],[.25,.7],[.5,.5]],a=[];for(let i=0;i<360;i++){let y=i%n;a.push({x:base[y].map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*.14),y})}return {centers:centroid(a,n),base}})();\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction acc(t,p){return (100*t.filter((v,i)=>v===p[i]).length/t.length).toFixed(1)+'%'}\nfunction run(){const param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],features=[],n=SPEC.classes.length;const exposure=param/100;let g=$('a').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';g.fillStyle='#3c5746';g.fillText('合成图像特征示意（非真实显微照片），绿框为正确，橙框为错误',10,20);for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=Math.floor(r()*n),raw=model.base[y].map(v=>Math.max(0,Math.min(1,v*exposure+(r()-.5)*noise))),x=raw.map(v=>v/Math.max(.1,exposure)),p=classify(x,model.centers),b=classify(raw,model.centers);truth.push(y);pred.push(p);base.push(b);features.push(x);let px=12+i%15*41,py=38+Math.floor(i/15)*35;g.fillStyle=TYPE==='fluoro'?'rgb('+Math.round(raw[0]*150)+','+Math.round(raw[0]*255)+','+Math.round(raw[1]*130)+')':\"rgb(\"+Math.round(raw[0]*255)+\",\"+Math.round(raw[1]*255)+\",120)\";g.fillRect(px,py,30,24);g.strokeStyle=p===y?'#3c886a':'#ce8b43';g.strokeRect(px-1,py-1,32,26)}confusion(truth,pred,n);metrics([['归一化 + 学习',acc(truth,pred)],['未校正基线',acc(truth,base)],['训练 / 测试','360 / 120'],['曝光倍率',exposure.toFixed(2)]]);$('explain').textContent='从独立训练样本学习各类特征中心；用已知标定曝光倍率校正测试特征，再按最近中心分类。混淆矩阵同时展示误判方向。岩屑以合成色调与纹理代理特征演示；荧光以强度与颜色代理特征演示，并非识别真实照片。曝光变化会影响噪声放大与饱和截断，校正不能恢复已丢失信息。';head=['sample','feature_1','feature_2','truth_class','corrected_prediction','uncorrected_prediction'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,...features[i],v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='gas'){let truth=[],raw=[],score=[],pred=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let event=i>=45&&i<75,drift=.008*i,v=model.mean+drift+(event?1.4*Math.sin((i-45)/30*Math.PI):0)+(r()-.5)*noise;raw.push(v);let z=(v-drift-model.mean)/model.sd;score.push(z);truth.push(event?1:0);pred.push(z>param/10?1:0);base.push(v>1.7?1:0)}function counts(p){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;p.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{f:(100*2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%',fp,fn}}let c=counts(pred);chart('a',[{v:raw,c:'#43836b'}],0,4,'序号（演示深度 = 2000 + 序号 m）','全烃 / 相对单位');chart('b',[{v:score,c:'#43836b'},{v:score.map(()=>param/10),c:'#c59048'},{v:truth.map(v=>v*8),c:'#648eae'}],-4,12,'深度采样序号','校正后 z 分数 / 阈值 / 真值×8');metrics([['学习基线 F1',c.f],['固定阈值 F1',counts(base).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['实际阈值',(param/10).toFixed(1)]]);$('explain').textContent='400 个正常样本学习全烃基线均值和标准差。演示用已知合成漂移作为工况校正量，校正后计算 z 分数并检测异常段。蓝色抬升为真值区间（乘 8 便于显示），橙为阈值；不是油气水类型鉴定，也不能排除接单根气或脱气效率变化。';head=['depth_m','total_gas_relative','z_score','truth','alarm','fixed_threshold_alarm'];rows=raw.map((v,i)=>[2000+i,v,score[i],truth[i],pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='layers'){let truth=[],raw=[],pred=[],curve=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=i<40?0:i<80?1:2,x=model.base[y].map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*noise);truth.push(y);curve.push(x[0]*10);raw.push(classify(x,model.centers))}let half=Math.floor(param/2);for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let votes=[0,0,0];for(let j=Math.max(0,i-half);j<=Math.min(119,i+half);j++)votes[raw[j]]++;pred.push(votes.indexOf(Math.max(...votes)))}let boundaries=a=>a.map((v,i)=>i&&v!==a[i-1]?i:-1).filter(i=>i>=0),edges=boundaries(pred),used=new Set(),tp=0;for(const e of edges){let k=[40,80].find(v=>Math.abs(v-e)<=2&&!used.has(v));if(k!==undefined){used.add(k);tp++}}let f=100*2*tp/Math.max(1,edges.length+2);chart('a',[{v:curve,c:'#43836b'}],0,12,'采样序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 m）','钻时 / min·m⁻¹');chart('b',[{v:truth,c:'#c59048'},{v:pred,c:'#43836b'},{v:raw,c:'#648eae'}],-.2,2.4,'深度采样序号','类别编码 0 / 1 / 2');metrics([['平滑分类准确率',acc(truth,pred)],['逐点基线准确率',acc(truth,raw)],['界面 F1（±2 m）',f.toFixed(1)+'%'],['预测界面数',edges.length]]);$('explain').textContent='从独立样本学习钻时与辅助录井特征的类别中心，逐点分类后采用可调多数窗平滑。橙：真值；绿：平滑；蓝：逐点。真值界面 2040、2080 m，按 ±2 m 一对一匹配计算界面 F1；大窗口可能抹掉薄层，本例不含迟到校正模块。';head=['depth_m','drilling_time_min_m','truth','smoothed','pointwise'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[2000+i,curve[i],v,pred[i],raw[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='report'){let records=[['R01','岩屑 砂岩 岩性 深度 2030 m'],['R02','气测 全烃 升高 显示 深度 2050 m'],['R03','停泵 接单根 工况 深度 2070 m'],['R04','岩屑 泥岩 岩性 深度 2090 m'],['R05','荧光 含油 显示 深度 2110 m'],['R06','循环 恢复 工况 深度 2130 m']];let truth=[2,0,1,2,0,1],pred=[],confidence=[],missing=0;records=records.map(([id,text])=>[id,text.split(' ').filter(word=>r()>noise*.7||/\\d/.test(word)).join(' ')]);for(let i=0;i<records.length;i++){let tokens=records[i][1].split(' '),logs=model.counts.map(c=>tokens.reduce((sum,w)=>sum+(model.vocab.has(w)?Math.log(((c.count[w]||0)+1)/(c.total+model.vocab.size)):0),Math.log(1/3))),mx=Math.max(...logs),weights=logs.map(v=>Math.exp(v-mx)),p=logs.indexOf(mx),conf=weights[p]/weights.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0);pred.push(p);confidence.push(conf);if(conf<param/100)missing++}confusion(truth,pred,3);chart('a',[{v:confidence,c:'#43836b'},{v:confidence.map(()=>param/100),c:'#c59048'}],0,1,'记录序号（R01–R06 对应 0–5）','分类后验分数 / 复核阈值');let report=[];for(let i=0;i<records.length;i++){let [id,text]=records[i],depth=text.match(/\\b(\\d{4})\\s*m\\b/),low=confidence[i]<param/100;report.push('['+id+'] '+(depth?depth[1]+' m':'深度缺失')+'｜'+(low?'待人工分类':model.cats[pred[i]])+'｜原始证据：'+text+'。'+(pred[i]===0?'仅记录显示，不推断产能或流体结论。':''))}$('report').textContent='录井报告初稿（待审核）\\n'+report.join('\\n');metrics([['文本分类准确率',acc(truth,pred)],['待复核记录',missing+' / 6'],['证据引用覆盖率','100%'],['训练记录 / 测试记录','9 / 6']]);$('explain').textContent='由 9 条短训练语料学习多项式朴素贝叶斯词频分布，使用拉普拉斯平滑进行记录分类。正则提取深度，按受约束模板生成带 R 编号的初稿。噪声滑块模拟词语缺失；阈值只控制转人工，不改变分类。后验分数未经校准，不能当作事实正确概率；这是 NLP 教学样例，不是大语言模型。';head=['source_id','source_text','truth_class','predicted_class','posterior_score','needs_review'];rows=records.map((v,i)=>[...v,truth[i],pred[i],confidence[i],confidence[i]<param/100?1:0]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<div>结果前五行（类别编码从 0 开始，见图例）</div><table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction labels(){$('pv').value=$('param').value+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2)}function flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){labels();if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(let id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='mudlog-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)};\n\nlet selected=5;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='report'?'训练：9条短语料；词表大小 '+model.vocab.size+'；类别 '+model.cats.join(' / '):JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent=TYPE==='report'?rows[selected][0]:'序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='gas'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):+(r[2]!==r[3]));$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">逐样本错误位置：高柱=判错，低柱=一致；横轴为原始记录顺序</text>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(130-v*85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+(v?85:3)+'\" fill=\"'+(v?'#b26a39':'#2f7d6b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect();selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width))*(rows.length-1));if(TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'){let x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640,y=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*340;selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(119,Math.floor((y-38)/35)*15+Math.floor((x-12)/41)))}inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=5;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"mudlogging-report-v22","sceneId":"m5","title":"录井报告自动生成：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"录井报告把分层、岩屑描述、气测显示与工况记录整合成可审核文本。自动生成的关键是事实与来源一致、缺失不补造、判断可追溯。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"朴素贝叶斯文本分类 + 证据模板生成","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"分类后的报告初稿及逐条来源引用","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"仅用微型语料演示，不调用大语言模型；词频分类不能理解否定和复杂语境，模板生成仍需人工审核。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"录井报告自动生成概念图\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><g fill=\"#345648\" font-size=\"18\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"55\">R01 岩屑记录</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"95\">R02 气测显示</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"135\">R03 工况记录</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"90\">→ 分类 / 抽取 → 带引用报告 → 人工审核</text></g></svg><p>概念示意，非真实样品或现场曲线。</p><p>录井报告把分层、岩屑描述、气测显示与工况记录整合成可审核文本。自动生成的关键是事实与来源一致、缺失不补造、判断可追溯。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：带编号的短录井记录与深度信息。方法：朴素贝叶斯文本分类 + 证据模板生成。输出：分类后的报告初稿及逐条来源引用。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>清洗并保留来源</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>训练词频分类器</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>抽取深度与填模板</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>低分转人工审核</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>记录 → 文本分类 → 深度抽取 → 引用与审核。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的带编号的短录井记录与深度信息，并由录井解释或验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；图像案例使用特征代理，不加载真实图像。报告训练与测试语料独立，规模仅作原理说明。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>仅用微型语料演示，不调用大语言模型；词频分类不能理解否定和复杂语境，模板生成仍需人工审核。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-mud-logging\">SLB：录井、迟到与荧光概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/naive_bayes.html\">朴素贝叶斯原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"录井报告自动生成：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 清洗并保留来源","role":"数据","do":"保留 R 编号、原始文本和深度；缺失字段不得补造。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 训练词频分类器","role":"学习","do":"用九条训练短记录统计各类词频，采用拉普拉斯平滑。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 抽取深度与填模板","role":"推理","do":"计算测试文本各类后验分数，用正则提取四位深度，套入模板。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 低分转人工审核","role":"验收","do":"低于阈值标记待人工分类，报告每句保留原文证据。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"仅用微型语料演示，不调用大语言模型；词频分类不能理解否定和复杂语境，模板生成仍需人工审核。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>清洗并保留来源</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>训练词频分类器</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>抽取深度与填模板</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>低分转人工审核</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"曝光、污染、脱气效率或钻井参数变化可造成分布漂移。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"岩屑混样、迟到校正与解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"仅用微型语料演示，不调用大语言模型；词频分类不能理解否定和复杂语境，模板生成仍需人工审核。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2922,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>录井报告自动生成</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>录井报告自动生成</h1><p class=\"lead\">录井报告把分层、岩屑描述、气测显示与工况记录整合成可审核文本。自动生成的关键是事实与来源一致、缺失不补造、判断可追溯。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>转人工阈值（百分数） <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"转人工阈值（百分数）\" type=\"range\" min=\"34\" max=\"99\" value=\"75\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 词语缺失 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">类别编码：0=显示；1=工况；2=岩性。图中单位及曲线含义见右侧说明。</div><figure><figcaption>文本类别分数与转人工阈值</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"文本类别分数与转人工阈值\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>记录类别混淆矩阵</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"记录类别混淆矩阵\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>朴素贝叶斯文本分类 + 证据模板生成；400条独立训练样本，换井不改变训练参数。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">仅用微型语料演示，不调用大语言模型；词频分类不能理解否定和复杂语境，模板生成仍需人工审核。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13319,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"report\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":75,\"inspect\":\"原文和R编号保留。分类后验未经校准，低分标记待人工；引用覆盖率不等于语义正确率。模型不理解复杂否定，不自动推断产能。\",\"classes\":[\"显示\",\"工况\",\"岩性\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),colors=['#43836b','#c59048','#648eae','#a2739b'];\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction centroid(samples,n){return Array.from({length:n},(_,k)=>{let a=samples.filter(d=>d.y===k);return a[0].x.map((_,j)=>a.reduce((v,d)=>v+d.x[j],0)/a.length)})}\nfunction classify(x,centers){let distances=centers.map(c=>c.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-x[j])**2,0));return distances.indexOf(Math.min(...distances))}\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel){let g=$(id).getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';const px=i=>55+i/(series[0].v.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;for(let i=0;i<5;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dde5d9';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#475d51';g.fillText(v.toFixed(1),4,y)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,200,328);for(let i=0;i<5;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].v.length-1)/4),55+i*140,306);for(const s of series){g.strokeStyle=s.c;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.v.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()}}\nfunction confusion(truth,pred,n){let m=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n).fill(0));truth.forEach((v,i)=>m[v][pred[i]]++);let g=$('b').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='14px sans-serif';g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText('行：真值；列：预测。数字为样本数',20,25);for(let i=0;i<n;i++){g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText(SPEC.classes[i],10,78+i*55);g.fillText(SPEC.classes[i],140+i*110,48);for(let j=0;j<n;j++){g.fillStyle=i===j?'#d6e9d8':'#f4e9dc';g.fillRect(140+j*110,55+i*55,100,45);g.fillStyle='#314e3f';g.fillText(m[i][j],180+j*110,84+i*55)}}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17);if(TYPE==='gas'){let a=Array.from({length:400},()=>.7+r()*.6);return {mean:a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/400,sd:Math.sqrt(a.reduce((s,v)=>s+(v-1)**2,0)/400)}}if(TYPE==='report'){let docs=[['气测 异常 全烃 升高 显示','显示'],['荧光 显示 含油 岩屑','显示'],['全烃 峰值 气测 显示','显示'],['接单根 停泵 工况 变化','工况'],['循环 停泵 恢复 工况','工况'],['扭矩 波动 工况 记录','工况'],['岩屑 砂岩 地层 岩性','岩性'],['泥岩 岩屑 岩性 描述','岩性'],['灰岩 地层 岩性 样品','岩性']];let cats=['显示','工况','岩性'],vocab=new Set(docs.flatMap(d=>d[0].split(' ')));return {cats,vocab,counts:cats.map(c=>{let count={},total=0;docs.filter(d=>d[1]===c).forEach(d=>d[0].split(' ').forEach(w=>{count[w]=(count[w]||0)+1;total++}));return {count,total}})}}let n=TYPE==='fluoro'?4:3,base=TYPE==='layers'?[[.3,.4],[.7,.8],[.5,.2]]:TYPE==='fluoro'?[[.16,.15],[.35,.28],[.58,.52],[.8,.72]]:[[.7,.3],[.25,.7],[.5,.5]],a=[];for(let i=0;i<360;i++){let y=i%n;a.push({x:base[y].map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*.14),y})}return {centers:centroid(a,n),base}})();\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction acc(t,p){return (100*t.filter((v,i)=>v===p[i]).length/t.length).toFixed(1)+'%'}\nfunction run(){const param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],features=[],n=SPEC.classes.length;const exposure=param/100;let g=$('a').getContext('2d');g.clearRect(0,0,640,340);g.font='12px sans-serif';g.fillStyle='#3c5746';g.fillText('合成图像特征示意（非真实显微照片），绿框为正确，橙框为错误',10,20);for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=Math.floor(r()*n),raw=model.base[y].map(v=>Math.max(0,Math.min(1,v*exposure+(r()-.5)*noise))),x=raw.map(v=>v/Math.max(.1,exposure)),p=classify(x,model.centers),b=classify(raw,model.centers);truth.push(y);pred.push(p);base.push(b);features.push(x);let px=12+i%15*41,py=38+Math.floor(i/15)*35;g.fillStyle=TYPE==='fluoro'?'rgb('+Math.round(raw[0]*150)+','+Math.round(raw[0]*255)+','+Math.round(raw[1]*130)+')':\"rgb(\"+Math.round(raw[0]*255)+\",\"+Math.round(raw[1]*255)+\",120)\";g.fillRect(px,py,30,24);g.strokeStyle=p===y?'#3c886a':'#ce8b43';g.strokeRect(px-1,py-1,32,26)}confusion(truth,pred,n);metrics([['归一化 + 学习',acc(truth,pred)],['未校正基线',acc(truth,base)],['训练 / 测试','360 / 120'],['曝光倍率',exposure.toFixed(2)]]);$('explain').textContent='从独立训练样本学习各类特征中心；用已知标定曝光倍率校正测试特征，再按最近中心分类。混淆矩阵同时展示误判方向。岩屑以合成色调与纹理代理特征演示；荧光以强度与颜色代理特征演示，并非识别真实照片。曝光变化会影响噪声放大与饱和截断，校正不能恢复已丢失信息。';head=['sample','feature_1','feature_2','truth_class','corrected_prediction','uncorrected_prediction'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,...features[i],v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='gas'){let truth=[],raw=[],score=[],pred=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let event=i>=45&&i<75,drift=.008*i,v=model.mean+drift+(event?1.4*Math.sin((i-45)/30*Math.PI):0)+(r()-.5)*noise;raw.push(v);let z=(v-drift-model.mean)/model.sd;score.push(z);truth.push(event?1:0);pred.push(z>param/10?1:0);base.push(v>1.7?1:0)}function counts(p){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;p.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{f:(100*2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%',fp,fn}}let c=counts(pred);chart('a',[{v:raw,c:'#43836b'}],0,4,'序号（演示深度 = 2000 + 序号 m）','全烃 / 相对单位');chart('b',[{v:score,c:'#43836b'},{v:score.map(()=>param/10),c:'#c59048'},{v:truth.map(v=>v*8),c:'#648eae'}],-4,12,'深度采样序号','校正后 z 分数 / 阈值 / 真值×8');metrics([['学习基线 F1',c.f],['固定阈值 F1',counts(base).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['实际阈值',(param/10).toFixed(1)]]);$('explain').textContent='400 个正常样本学习全烃基线均值和标准差。演示用已知合成漂移作为工况校正量，校正后计算 z 分数并检测异常段。蓝色抬升为真值区间（乘 8 便于显示），橙为阈值；不是油气水类型鉴定，也不能排除接单根气或脱气效率变化。';head=['depth_m','total_gas_relative','z_score','truth','alarm','fixed_threshold_alarm'];rows=raw.map((v,i)=>[2000+i,v,score[i],truth[i],pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='layers'){let truth=[],raw=[],pred=[],curve=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=i<40?0:i<80?1:2,x=model.base[y].map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*noise);truth.push(y);curve.push(x[0]*10);raw.push(classify(x,model.centers))}let half=Math.floor(param/2);for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let votes=[0,0,0];for(let j=Math.max(0,i-half);j<=Math.min(119,i+half);j++)votes[raw[j]]++;pred.push(votes.indexOf(Math.max(...votes)))}let boundaries=a=>a.map((v,i)=>i&&v!==a[i-1]?i:-1).filter(i=>i>=0),edges=boundaries(pred),used=new Set(),tp=0;for(const e of edges){let k=[40,80].find(v=>Math.abs(v-e)<=2&&!used.has(v));if(k!==undefined){used.add(k);tp++}}let f=100*2*tp/Math.max(1,edges.length+2);chart('a',[{v:curve,c:'#43836b'}],0,12,'采样序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 m）','钻时 / min·m⁻¹');chart('b',[{v:truth,c:'#c59048'},{v:pred,c:'#43836b'},{v:raw,c:'#648eae'}],-.2,2.4,'深度采样序号','类别编码 0 / 1 / 2');metrics([['平滑分类准确率',acc(truth,pred)],['逐点基线准确率',acc(truth,raw)],['界面 F1（±2 m）',f.toFixed(1)+'%'],['预测界面数',edges.length]]);$('explain').textContent='从独立样本学习钻时与辅助录井特征的类别中心，逐点分类后采用可调多数窗平滑。橙：真值；绿：平滑；蓝：逐点。真值界面 2040、2080 m，按 ±2 m 一对一匹配计算界面 F1；大窗口可能抹掉薄层，本例不含迟到校正模块。';head=['depth_m','drilling_time_min_m','truth','smoothed','pointwise'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[2000+i,curve[i],v,pred[i],raw[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='report'){let records=[['R01','岩屑 砂岩 岩性 深度 2030 m'],['R02','气测 全烃 升高 显示 深度 2050 m'],['R03','停泵 接单根 工况 深度 2070 m'],['R04','岩屑 泥岩 岩性 深度 2090 m'],['R05','荧光 含油 显示 深度 2110 m'],['R06','循环 恢复 工况 深度 2130 m']];let truth=[2,0,1,2,0,1],pred=[],confidence=[],missing=0;records=records.map(([id,text])=>[id,text.split(' ').filter(word=>r()>noise*.7||/\\d/.test(word)).join(' ')]);for(let i=0;i<records.length;i++){let tokens=records[i][1].split(' '),logs=model.counts.map(c=>tokens.reduce((sum,w)=>sum+(model.vocab.has(w)?Math.log(((c.count[w]||0)+1)/(c.total+model.vocab.size)):0),Math.log(1/3))),mx=Math.max(...logs),weights=logs.map(v=>Math.exp(v-mx)),p=logs.indexOf(mx),conf=weights[p]/weights.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0);pred.push(p);confidence.push(conf);if(conf<param/100)missing++}confusion(truth,pred,3);chart('a',[{v:confidence,c:'#43836b'},{v:confidence.map(()=>param/100),c:'#c59048'}],0,1,'记录序号（R01–R06 对应 0–5）','分类后验分数 / 复核阈值');let report=[];for(let i=0;i<records.length;i++){let [id,text]=records[i],depth=text.match(/\\b(\\d{4})\\s*m\\b/),low=confidence[i]<param/100;report.push('['+id+'] '+(depth?depth[1]+' m':'深度缺失')+'｜'+(low?'待人工分类':model.cats[pred[i]])+'｜原始证据：'+text+'。'+(pred[i]===0?'仅记录显示，不推断产能或流体结论。':''))}$('report').textContent='录井报告初稿（待审核）\\n'+report.join('\\n');metrics([['文本分类准确率',acc(truth,pred)],['待复核记录',missing+' / 6'],['证据引用覆盖率','100%'],['训练记录 / 测试记录','9 / 6']]);$('explain').textContent='由 9 条短训练语料学习多项式朴素贝叶斯词频分布，使用拉普拉斯平滑进行记录分类。正则提取深度，按受约束模板生成带 R 编号的初稿。噪声滑块模拟词语缺失；阈值只控制转人工，不改变分类。后验分数未经校准，不能当作事实正确概率；这是 NLP 教学样例，不是大语言模型。';head=['source_id','source_text','truth_class','predicted_class','posterior_score','needs_review'];rows=records.map((v,i)=>[...v,truth[i],pred[i],confidence[i],confidence[i]<param/100?1:0]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<div>结果前五行（类别编码从 0 开始，见图例）</div><table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction labels(){$('pv').value=$('param').value+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2)}function flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){labels();if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(let id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='mudlog-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)};\n\nlet selected=5;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='report'?'训练：9条短语料；词表大小 '+model.vocab.size+'；类别 '+model.cats.join(' / '):JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent=TYPE==='report'?rows[selected][0]:'序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='gas'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):+(r[2]!==r[3]));$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">逐样本错误位置：高柱=判错，低柱=一致；横轴为原始记录顺序</text>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(130-v*85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+(v?85:3)+'\" fill=\"'+(v?'#b26a39':'#2f7d6b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect();selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width))*(rows.length-1));if(TYPE==='cuttings'||TYPE==='fluoro'){let x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640,y=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*340;selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(119,Math.floor((y-38)/35)*15+Math.floor((x-12)/41)))}inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=5;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}